<title>HONG KONG: Jardine Davies 1996 net 49.82 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Jardine Davies 1996 net 49.82 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in million Philippine pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)  1.66     vs 7.18</p>
<p>    Turnover			  2,573.64 vs 2,338.83</p>
<p>    Net Profit			   49.82 vs   165.90</p>
<p>Note - Jardine Davies Inc has interests in building and industrial materials, housing, agribusiness, finance and corporate services.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
</text>
